! IONEFFECTS with the Gaussian field on three bunches: each bunch's kicks go to its own rows of the device's
! beam. Identical here; the
! device's exp and Faddeeva function could differ by rounding
Q1: QUAD, L=0.2, K1=0.9
Q2: QUAD, L=0.2, K1=-0.9
D: DRIF, L=0.4
X: IONEFFECTS
Y: IONEFFECTS
C: CHARGE, TOTAL=1e-9
CELL: LINE=(Q1, D, X, D, Q2, D, Y, D)
BL: LINE=(C, 5*CELL)
MAKE: LINE=(D)
